Package: mitranet-network-engine
Version: 1.0.2-1~deb13u1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: MitraNet Core Team <support@mitranet.id>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.13), iproute2 (>= 6.12), nftables (>= 1.1.0)
Recommends: wireguard-tools, bridge-utils
Description: MitraNet Linux In-Tree Network & Firewall Engine
 MitraNet Rinjani 1.0.2 native Linux networking engine.
 Provides full netlink and iproute2 orchestrations for Interfaces,
 IPv4/IPv6 Static Routing, 802.1Q VLANs, Linux Bridges, LACP Bonding,
 VRF Lite domains, and Netfilter/nftables ruleset management.
